# Title: Non-privileged Usage of Reg or Powershell
# ID: 8f02c935-effe-45b3-8fc9-ef8696a9e41d
# Status: test
# Level: high
# Author: Teymur Kheirkhabarov (idea), Ryan Plas (rule), oscd.community
# Date: 2020-10-05
# Tags: attack.persistence, attack.defense-impairment, attack.t1112
# Description: Search for usage of reg or Powershell by non-privileged users to modify service configuration in registry
# Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

((((CommandLine CONTAIN "reg " AND CommandLine CONTAIN "add")) OR ((CommandLine CONTAIN "powershell" OR CommandLine CONTAIN "set-itemproperty" OR CommandLine CONTAIN " sp " OR CommandLine CONTAIN "new-itemproperty"))) AND ((IntegrityLevel = "Medium" OR IntegrityLevel = "S-1-16-8192") AND (CommandLine CONTAIN "ControlSet" AND CommandLine CONTAIN "Services") AND (CommandLine CONTAIN "ImagePath" OR CommandLine CONTAIN "FailureCommand" OR CommandLine CONTAIN "ServiceDLL")))
